---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Aerosect"
  description="Learn about Aerosect, a visual article archive for aerospace, technology, history, ideas, and stories connected to flight."
>
  <section class="about">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Aerosect</p>

    <h1>A visual archive for flight, technology, and ideas.</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      Aerosect is being built as a home for clear, visual, and curious articles
      on aerospace, technology, history, culture, travel, and the wider ideas
      connected to flight.
    </p>

    <p>
      The aim is to make complex subjects easier to explore without losing the
      texture, context, or human stories that make them memorable.
    </p>

    <p>
      Over time, Aerosect will grow into a platform for visual essays,
      explainers, interactive pieces, and resources for engineers, researchers,
      travellers, history enthusiasts, and curious readers.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    margin: 110px 0 0;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 980px;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4.8rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    margin: 18px 0 36px;
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 820px;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  p {
    max-width: 760px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  p + p {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
  }
</style>
